{"m2halftrack" "The M2 half-track was an armoured vehicle produced by the United States during World War II. M2 - White half-track with White 160AX engine. Fitted with a skate rail mount, featuring an M2HB machine gun. The first M2s were fielded in 1941, and would be used in the Philippines, North Africa, and Europe by the U.S. Army, and around the Pacific by the Marines."}
